From: Will Faust <willtechnoduck@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 23:56:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] iOS-Mythic: #60 drain self-repair + L1 cap + EC exception
 hardening (ml389-ml417)

- WritePriorityMutex: drain self-repair restamps owner=self, closing the
  rpmalloc ownership-identity livelock (#60)
- LookupCache: L1 cap 1M -> 128K (VA diet)
- Module.cpp: EC exception-path hardening
- External/rpmalloc: VirtualAlloc2 exact-aligned 64MB spans (#62, db 5392)

Madeira-commit: 90a30158427309fc550fc9b3d88e19fc5a977067
Rebased: resolved
Class: madeira-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-24-fex-latest-rebase.md
